{
  "title": "AI Memory: Assistants That Remember Each User | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "An assistant that forgets you after every chat makes you repeat yourself. The CrestApps AI Memory feature lets an assistant in Orchard Core remember stable, non-sensitive facts about each signed-in user, such as a preferred name or style, and use them in later chats. Memory is private to each person, and people can clear it from their own profile.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why memory helps, and what it is and is not for\n• Creating the memory index, and choosing it in the site settings\n• Turning memory on for a profile\n• Chatting with an assistant that remembers\n• Seeing and clearing the saved memory\n• Use cases",
